{
  "resume": "=== Ayele Rose Bethel Dounou - Resume.pdf ===\nAYELE ROSE BETHEL DOUNOU \n\nBronx, NY 10456 \n347-849-8594 | Rosedounou@gmail.com \n\nPROFESSIONAL SUMMARY \n\nMotivated and customer-focused professional with experience in hospitality, guest services, \ncustomer service, and event support. Skilled in communication, teamwork, leadership, and \nproblem-solving in fast-paced environments. Passionate about serving others, supporting \ncommunity initiatives, and creating positive experiences for guests and clients. \n\nEDUCATION \n\nInternational Community High School \u2014 Bronx, NY \nHigh School Diploma, 2024 \n\nPROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE \n\nCatering & Events Assistant \n\nHavana Central | New York, NY \nFebruary 2026 \u2013 Present \n\n\u25cf  Assisted with event setup, service, and cleanup. \n\u25cf  Provided excellent customer service to guests. \n\u25cf  Coordinated with kitchen and event staff to ensure smooth event operations. \n\u25cf  Maintained cleanliness and adhered to food safety standards. \n\u25cf  Restocked supplies and monitored food stations during events. \n\nHost \n\nHavana Central | New York, NY \nSeptember 2025 \u2013 Present \n\n\u25cf  Greet guests and create a welcoming dining experience. \n\u25cf  Manage reservations and waitlists efficiently. \n\u25cf  Seat guests and coordinate table assignments. \n\u25cf  Communicate with servers and management to maintain smooth service. \n\u25cf  Address guest questions and concerns professionally. \n\n\fUsher / Guest Services \n\nMadison Square Garden Entertainment Corp. | New York, NY \nSeptember 2024 \u2013 October 2025 \n\n\u25cf  Managed guest flow during events and performances. \n\u25cf  Delivered exceptional customer service to patrons. \n\u25cf  Maintained a safe and secure environment. \n\u25cf  Utilized ticketing and point-of-sale systems. \n\u25cf  Collaborated with team members to resolve guest concerns. \n\u25cf  Maintained clean and organized guest areas. \n\nCrew Member / Cashier \n\nDunkin' | New York, NY \nMay 2023 \u2013 January 2025 \n\n\u25cf  Processed customer orders accurately and efficiently. \n\u25cf  Prepared food and beverage items according to company standards. \n\u25cf  Handled cash and electronic transactions. \n\u25cf  Maintained cleanliness in dining and kitchen areas. \n\u25cf  Delivered excellent customer service in a fast-paced environment. \n\nCashier / Customer Service Representative \n\nRose Boutique | Conakry, Guinea \nOctober 2018 \u2013 June 2021 \n\n\u25cf  Assisted customers and provided high-quality service. \n\u25cf  Resolved customer concerns and inquiries. \n\u25cf  Processed sales transactions and managed cash handling. \n\u25cf  Assisted with inventory management and stock organization. \n\nVOLUNTEER EXPERIENCE \n\nYouth Ministry Leader \n\nSaint Anthony of Padua Parish | Bronx, NY \nSeptember 2025 \u2013 Present \n\n\u25cf  Lead and mentor middle and high school students through faith-based programs. \n\u25cf  Plan activities, retreats, service projects, and community outreach initiatives. \n\u25cf  Provide guidance and support to encourage personal and spiritual growth. \n\u25cf  Collaborate with parish leaders, volunteers, and parents. \n\n\fVolunteer \n\nFr\u00e8res Unis | Bronx, NY \nSeptember 2022 \u2013 Present \n\n\u25cf  Assist with fundraising efforts and donation drives. \n\u25cf  Support educational and healthcare initiatives in Guinea. \n\u25cf  Coordinate collection and distribution of supplies for families in need. \n\nTranslator \n\nInternational Community High School | Bronx, NY \nJanuary 2022 \u2013 June 2022 \n\n\u25cf  Assisted students and families by translating between teachers and students. \n\u25cf  Supported communication to help students meet academic goals. \n\nIntern \n\nSpeakHire | Bronx, NY \nJuly 2022 \u2013 May 2024 \n\n\u25cf  Participated in leadership development and career readiness programs. \n\u25cf  Received professional coaching on resumes, interviews, and workplace skills. \n\u25cf  Completed individual projects focused on professional growth. \n\nSKILLS \n\n\u25cf  Customer Service \n\u25cf  Hospitality & Guest Relations \n\u25cf  Event Support & Catering \n\u25cf  Leadership & Teamwork \n\u25cf  Communication \n\u25cf  Time Management \n\u25cf  Problem Solving \n\u25cf  Microsoft Office \n\u25cf  Google Workspace \n\nLanguages: English, French, Fulani, Sosso, Mandingo, Ewe \n\nACHIEVEMENTS \n\n\u25cf  Salutatorian, Class of 2024 \n\u25cf  Student Government President \n\n\f\u25cf  School Ambassador \n\u25cf  Perfect Attendance Award (2021\u20132022) \n\u25cf  Published family recipe in Food Memories: A Collection of Recipes from the Heart",
